# The shop's balancer: the office on one side, the servers on the other.
#
#   office 10.0.9.2 ---- shop ---- lb 10.0.9.1    HAProxy: the shop's address
#                                  lb 10.0.1.1
#                                    |
#                                 servers
#       web1 .11, web2 .12, web3 .13   the web servers (port 8080)
#       api1 .21, api2 .22             the API servers (port 8081)
#       stock1 .31, stock2 .32         the stock service (port 7000)
#       db .20                         the database (port 5432)
#
# The office reaches only the balancer; the servers' programs are units on
# the lab machine (shop-web@web1, stock-sync@stock1, shop-db@db).
machine office
machine lb
machine web1
machine web2
machine web3
machine api1
machine api2
machine stock1
machine stock2
machine db

lan shop office:eth0=10.0.9.2/24 lb:eth0=10.0.9.1/24
lan servers lb:eth1=10.0.1.1/24 web1:eth0=10.0.1.11/24 web2:eth0=10.0.1.12/24 web3:eth0=10.0.1.13/24 db:eth0=10.0.1.20/24 api1:eth0=10.0.1.21/24 api2:eth0=10.0.1.22/24 stock1:eth0=10.0.1.31/24 stock2:eth0=10.0.1.32/24

run lb haproxy
